WEBVTT

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.600
<i>Jem!</i>

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.310
I told you not to take a bath

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.850
when you're morphed!
The feathers clog the drain!

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:09.360
Can't I take a bath how I want?

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.820
Can't you even keep
a simple promise like that?

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.570
The Silver Wolf is watching, you know!

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.070
Silver Wolf...

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:20.280
Michiru, don't you even know
who Silver Wolf is?

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.290
I heard a little bit.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:25.620
That's no good! Allow me to explain!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>Beastmen and humans have had</i>
<i>varying relationships in every era.</i>

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:34.960
<i>But no matter the era,</i>
<i>beastmen have always encountered a crisis.</i>

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:38.260
<i>That's when our savior arrives.</i>

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.800
<i>That savior is Silver Wolf.</i>

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:42.930
<i>In the past 1,000 years,</i>

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:47.310
<i>there have been legends of Silver Wolf</i>
<i>saving beastmen all over the world.</i>

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:50.020
Did you draw these, Jem?

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.020
This is how I'll make money
for my retirement.

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:54.900
Quit changing the subject!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:57.450
-You're always doing that!
-Are you going out?

00:01:57.990 --> 00:01:59.200
Are you even listening?

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.530
I think I'll join you.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:02.870
Hey, you two!

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.330
Here.

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:11.250
You always give me one of these.
What is it?

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:14.250
It's a good luck charm to keep you safe.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.760
Give it to Silver Wolf when he helps you.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.420
Really?

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:19.760
Thank you.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.930
You'll get in trouble!

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:30.100
A god isn't someone who will only help
people if you give him food in exchange.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.860
You always have a say
about everything people believe in.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.190
No wonder you have no friends.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:39.860
You don't have any either.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.530
I had a ton of friends.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:46.490
I even had a best friend.
She's super pretty.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:48.370
Why are you bragging?

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.580
Because I'm so proud of her.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:53.330
And your name is?

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:57.010
It's Nazuna! Even backward, it's Nazuna!

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:59.010
My dreams are your dreams!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.890
From every angle you look at me,
I'm 100 percent a pop idol!

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:03.970
I'm Nazuna Hiwatashi!

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:09.680
That will be a hit for sure!
When are you going to audition anyway?

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:14.360
I don't want to be chosen by anyone.
I want to be the one doing the choosing.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.900
You're afraid, aren't you?

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.820
What?

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:21.070
We almost died in that accident.
We shouldn't be afraid of anything.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.820
Every adversity is an opportunity!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:25.990
You should become a real pop idol!

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.200
Hey! That's dangerous!

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.670
I'm not giving up on basketball either.
Let's each take our own path

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.630
and be the best in the world at it!

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.590
We can become anything we want!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.510
You sure are amazing, Michiru.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.850
<i>But then one day, before my very eyes...</i>

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.770
She was kidnapped before my very eyes.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:54.600
What?

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:57.860
If you're looking for Ogami,
he's with the mayor.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.400
Here.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.570
BILL: 500,000 YEN

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.400
This month's mobile phone bill.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.370
I need to pay you for this too?

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.120
If you can't pay, then earn it.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:14.250
Sell these at a high price
to those fools in the slums.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:22.920
What a drag. Why do I have to commit
a crime, so I can pay my phone bill?

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.050
Michiru!

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.390
Jackie!

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:26.890
Isn't that...

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.810
Look at this water purifier.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:32.350
They said this will even turn
muddy water into French water.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:36.150
I bought it on credit.
Lifetime installment payments!

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:39.270
Hey! Who's Jackie?

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:43.740
I warned you not to pay by installments!

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:47.450
I never realized how much fun
shopping could be, so I couldn't help it.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:53.330
Collecting debts from you people
won't get me much money at all,

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:56.000
so this is the perfect chance
to teach you a lesson.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.340
Anyone who's late in their payments,

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.880
even by just a single day,
gets burned at the stake!

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.430
Jackie!

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:10.810
Out of the way!

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.310
Jackie!

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.810
What the heck is that?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.420
Cease this, wayward Sylvanians.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.380
Who the hell are you?

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:42.250
Sylvanians harming Sylvanians...

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:45.470
That behavior is beneath even humans.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:47.590
What kind of garbage is that?

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:51.050
Anyone who doesn't pay their debts
is neither human nor Sylvanian!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:55.060
They're trash!
Trash has to be cleaned off the streets!

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.680
They are not trash.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.980
All of us are noble Sylvanians.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:02.320
We must take pride in that.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.900
Silver Wolf is watching.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:09.780
What a moron! Silver Wolf is a sham
that weaklings believe in!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.200
Let us rejoice!

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.290
The silver light shines down on

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.830
even the most shameless
and ignorant Sylvanians.

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:25.460
The founder of the Church
of the Silver Wolf, Déesse Louve,

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:29.260
has descended upon
the beastman metropolis, Anima-City.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:32.720
I could care less if she's the founder.
Back off!

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:35.260
Get in my way,
and I'll burn you at the stake too!

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.270
There!

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.440
Jackie!

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.400
Burn!

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.860
That's hot!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:48.320
It's burning my flesh! What a nice smell!

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:00.460
It's Silver Wolf!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.620
Our lord, Silver Wolf!

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.500
What are you waiting for? Shoot her!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:10.590
I can't! I can't shoot!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.220
Please forgive me!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.930
Pull yourselves together, you bums!

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:23.060
That's Silver Wolf?

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:26.020
Silver Wolf is the god of Sylvanians.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.150
Her silver light extinguishes hardship
and fear.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:32.950
Praise our lord and savior, Silver Wolf!

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.670
Déesse Louve,

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:47.590
-our blessed mistress of Silver Wolf.
-What?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:52.550
The silver light is with all of us.
Let us all shine with silver light.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.010
Hey! That's Nazuna!

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.890
Hey, Nazuna!

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.560
It's me!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.890
Hey, what are you doing?

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.310
"Even backward..."

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:13.400
Step aside.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:18.490
I sense a powerful evil emanating
from this one.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:21.410
Stay away from her
until I say it's all right.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.090
Michiru? I knew it was you, Michiru!

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:37.470
What are you doing here?
Don't tell me you're a beastman too?

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.550
Nazuna...

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.930
Oh, this is...

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.810
Thank goodness you're alive!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.650
Thank goodness you're all right!

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:49.610
Michiru...

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.070
You're a tanuki?

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.320
I'm a raccoon!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.660
It happened not long after
it happened to you.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.160
I've only been living here
for a short time.

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:03.910
Déesse Louve!

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.080
Come with me!

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.210
Wait!

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.590
Are you sure it's okay to ignore them?

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:18.550
Yes, it will be okay.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.470
-Nazuna, why--
-Hold on, you're a tanuki.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:24.310
You're not a raccoon.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.490
You're not fooling anyone
by calling yourself a raccoon.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:45.620
I couldn't help it. You're Silver Wolf,
but I'm just a tanuki.

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.080
Watch this.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:58.590
I'm not Silver Wolf. I'm a fox.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.550
A fox? You mean you're faking it?

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:03.680
You have to keep it a secret.

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.060
If anyone finds out, there'll be trouble.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:08.230
All right.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:12.150
Michiru, don't tell me
you can't turn back into a human.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.820
Well, at first, I couldn't. But now I can.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.610
Then why are you like that?

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.490
Isn't it more comfortable like this?

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.660
Oh, I know! Come over to my place!

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:27.410
There's so much I want to tell you!

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.660
You live here?

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:29.750
Yes!

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:31.880
Really? Let's go!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:33.590
Yes, let's go!

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.630
<i>The Church of the Silver Wolf.</i>

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:39.010
They're a religious group
that worships Silver Wolf

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:41.590
and travels around the world
demanding freedom for beastmen.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:45.560
I heard rumors, but I can't believe
that their founder is Silver Wolf.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.020
Full morph, huh?

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:51.480
Ordinary beastmen can't do that.

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.940
Even so, will you allow them in?

00:10:55.320 --> 00:11:00.240
We accept all beastmen.
That's the basic principle of this city.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:02.780
You don't like it?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:03.740
No.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.700
It figures.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.710
I've been putting off meeting them
until our investigation is done.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.500
But meeting with them directly
to decide could be faster.

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:18.420
<i>So you saw when I was captured.</i>

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.380
I was kind of far,
so I didn't get a good look.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:25.890
But after that, you weren't around.
That's when I finally understood.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:29.930
I was really scared.
I thought they were going to kill me.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:32.350
I mean, I have already morphed
into a beastman.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.150
Talk about freaking out!

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:35.150
I totally get it.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:39.650
I was taken to some kind
of weird research facility.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.860
That's where Cliff Boris rescued me.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:46.580
He knew I had the ability
to do a full morph.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:52.040
He trained me, then we joined
the Church of the Silver Wolf.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.790
Since I could morph into Silver Wolf,
I became the founder,

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:57.550
and Boris became the chief mentor.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:02.130
Is Boris the guy wearing the mask
who was with you?

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.260
That's right.

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:06.510
Are you sure you can trust him?
He seems pretty dodgy.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:08.100
He's not dodgy.

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.730
Have you seen him with his mask off?

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.560
-No.
-He always wears that mask?

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.520
Isn't that creepy?

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:16.940
No, it's not creepy.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:21.440
I told you, Boris is the one
who saved me from that facility.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:23.360
He's not a bad guy.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.280
All right then,

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:26.910
if you say so.

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:36.330
How long have you been like this, Michiru?

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:38.710
Not long after it happened to you, Nazuna.

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:44.340
For a while, I hid at home,
but I wanted to find a way to morph back.

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:48.050
I thought coming here might help.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.600
But nobody knows about our disease.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:52.560
Disease?

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:55.190
I think it's a disease.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.770
-Beastman disease.
-Beastman disease, huh?

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.030
It looks like you're having fun though.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:08.240
Really?
That was pretty darn harsh, you know!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:13.410
-It looks like you've got lots of friends.
-Well, there are bad people here,

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.920
but there are lots of people
that help you out too.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:18.420
Is that right?

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.880
Is this the mayor of Anima-City?

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:26.800
Yes. I help her out sometimes too.

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.050
So...

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.060
why don't we live here together?

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.520
Quit playing the founder of that religion.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:39.020
I swear we can find a way to cure this.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:42.270
Let's work together
until we can become humans again!

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:45.820
Oh, he's back!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.070
Welcome home, Shirou.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.700
Thanks.

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:53.330
Hey, Shirou! Melissa!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.580
Can I let my friend live here?

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.290
Your friend?

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:04.590
No.

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.550
What? Why?

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:08.130
Not her.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.760
I'll be going.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.350
Wait, Nazuna!

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:17.230
Hold it! Don't tell me
that friend of yours is a human.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:18.600
That's right.

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:21.190
Like me, Nazuna has the beastman disease.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:24.650
Why can I stay here but Nazuna can't?

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:28.450
That religion is fishy. We are not sure
if they are a legitimate group.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.070
I can't trust that woman.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:32.450
That's so uncool.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.540
Why don't you just kick me out too?

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.840
Excuse me!

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.340
I'm Michiru Kagemori!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:49.590
Let me join your church!

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:54.310
Master Boris.

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:04.860
When I saw the founder this afternoon,
I was so moved!

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:06.480
Please let me join!

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.030
Very well.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:11.450
As Silver Wolf wishes.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.330
What's with that guy? He creeps me out.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:19.200
My new sister, take this.

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.620
I will show you to your tent.

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:25.590
Okay! Thank you!

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:31.470
I can't get an appointment with the mayor.
She says she's quite busy.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.050
Is that right?

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:38.850
Actually, just a moment ago,
a girl named Kagemori joined the Church.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.190
Do you know her?

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:42.560
No.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.320
Always remain beautiful.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:53.240
More beautiful than a god.

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:12.300
I heard from Boris.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.680
I can't believe you joined the Church.

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:19.260
Let's run away together.
That Boris is way creepier than I thought.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.640
Don't trust that guy!

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:25.310
Michiru, you really are stupid,
aren't you?

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:26.230
What?

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:27.900
Keep your voice down!

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.780
You should go back, Michiru.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.190
What?

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:35.280
It looks like Anima-City
won't allow the Church in.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:39.200
We just might have to leave at this rate.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:43.370
How come? You'll go with them?
Why can't you stay here, Nazuna?

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.540
Unlike you, Michiru,
I don't have a place here.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.510
Even that guy said no to me, right?

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:52.590
But...

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.340
The mayor won't meet with us either.

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:56.840
The mayor?

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:58.600
You went to meet her?

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:01.970
Well, more like she refused to see us.

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.020
You can see her.

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:09.690
Leave it to me. I know
where she has breakfast every morning.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.030
I'll go with you and ask her.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:15.780
I'm sure she'll understand
once we tell her about you.

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.620
Let's go before everyone gets up.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.540
What? What are you doing?

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.040
We need to start early,
so let's go to bed.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.290
I'm sure it will be fine.

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.750
Now we can be together, Nazuna.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:39.850
Mayor Rosé!

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:41.310
Michiru.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.020
I brought someone with me
I want you to meet.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.560
She knows that I'm--

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.400
I'm the founder of the Church
of the Silver Wolf, Déesse Louve.

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:52.270
Thank you for setting aside the time
to meet with me.

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.610
I have come to request permission
for permanent residency

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:58.610
in Anima-City for members
of the Church of the Silver Wolf.

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:00.910
Nazuna?

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:03.700
If that's what you want...

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.120
Why won't you accept our request?

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:11.210
Doesn't Anima-City accept all beastmen?
Is that promise a lie?

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.420
To beastmen, Silver Wolf is sacred.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:18.380
Using that
for your own benefit is unacceptable.

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:21.970
This city is open to all beastmen.

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:27.310
But this city doesn't need those
who falsely claim to be beastmen.

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:29.230
Wait. She's...

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:33.110
Admittedly, I am a human.
I am not the legendary Silver Wolf.

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:34.570
That's for sure.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:38.950
But does Silver Wolf even exist?

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:42.070
An immortal wolf beastman
who's lived for 1,000 years?

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:45.040
And though he's a beastman,
he has the form of a wolf?

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:47.290
Of course he doesn't exist.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:51.080
But beastmen have been
so utterly oppressed

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:55.420
that they've clung desperately
to this lie and asked for its assistance.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:56.550
Am I right?

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:01.340
That's why I am turning this lie
into the truth.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:03.300
For the happiness of beastmen.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:05.850
I am not promoting false hopes.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.680
I am manifesting their hopes.

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:12.270
That hope is something
that's needed in Anima-City as well.

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:14.770
Isn't that right, Mayor Barballet Rosé?

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:16.980
Nazuna...

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:22.490
Your friend is quite interesting.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:27.290
Come to the city hall this afternoon.
We'll sign you up for permanent residency.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:29.410
Yes.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.340
What a great morning!

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.380
I'm starving now.

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:42.130
Hey.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:43.390
What is it?

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.430
That's what I want to know.

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.930
Don't act like that. You tricked me.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.220
Tricked you?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:52.100
I wanted to help you
because I felt sorry for you

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:54.310
for being forced to be
the Church's founder.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.480
But what was that just now?
Were you just using me?

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.450
You're freaking me out.

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:06.620
You always get upset when things
aren't exactly the way you expect.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.950
I didn't have to rely on you, Michiru.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.630
But you were so smug that you could
set up a meeting with the mayor.

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.630
You said the mayor wouldn't see you.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:21.590
Do you think the mayor conceded
because I asked her just now?

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:23.550
Of course not!

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:25.590
That was already going to happen.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:28.600
She was obviously investigating
the Church already.

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:34.100
So you see,
even if you hadn't gotten involved,

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:36.230
the result wouldn't have been
any different.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:39.150
Then why did you ask me to do that?

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:40.570
I didn't ask you.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:45.780
From the start, you did it on your own
because you assumed I wanted it.

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:46.950
I assumed it?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:51.200
In fact, I never said I wanted to quit
as the founder.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:52.660
What?

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.210
See? You still don't get it.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:58.670
Why in the world would I quit?
I've finally become a pop idol.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:00.130
A pop idol?

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.760
Being the founder is like
being a pop idol.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:08.800
Tons of beastmen worship and praise me.
They pin their hopes and dreams on me.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.510
That's what a pop idol is!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:15.020
Are you nuts? You're satisfied using
that creepy guy to become a pop idol?

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:19.360
-How can a church founder be a pop idol?
-You haven't changed a bit, Michiru.

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:23.610
<i>When something happens before your eyes,</i>

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:26.490
<i>you always jump in</i>
<i>without thinking about the consequences.</i>

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.780
<i>That part of you</i>
<i>still hasn't changed a bit.</i>

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:31.870
Jumping to conclusions,

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:35.160
taking pity on me
just because you feel sorry for me,

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.500
then deciding you need to help me.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.840
You're only doing it because
you want to feel good about yourself.

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.090
You can't be serious.

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:46.170
And as for Boris,
he's not as creepy as you say.

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:47.380
That's not true!

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:49.850
There you go again
pressing your beliefs on me.

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:54.270
I decided to do
whatever it takes to achieve my dream.

00:21:54.770 --> 00:21:56.520
Right now, I'm no longer Nazuna.

00:21:56.890 --> 00:21:59.940
I'm the blessed mistress of Silver Wolf,
Déesse Louve!

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:04.690
Fine. If that's what you want, go ahead.

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:06.450
However,

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:10.410
I sure as heck don't have
any friend named Déesse whatever!

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:50.030
Why?

00:22:50.110 --> 00:22:52.120
Subtitle translation by Brian Athey
